# Enroll a New App with GitOps

> **Confidential — internal use only.** Keep credentials, signing material, private artifacts, and sensitive logs in approved Enterprise systems. Examples use synthetic identities.

Submit one create-only YAML request. Protected platform automation creates the Bitrise app and binds approved resources. Existing apps reuse their identity.

The handbook's console walkthrough describes underlying settings, but its final mandate and earlier workshop require **GitOps provisioning**. Developers do not run the Add New App wizard or upload signing credentials manually.

