### Source severity actions

| Severity | CVSS v3.1 score | Gate | Source-described follow-up |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Critical | 9.0–10.0 | Fail; block delivery. | Alert security leads and create a high-priority remediation issue. |
| High | 7.0–8.9 | Fail; block delivery. | Alert and create a remediation issue. |
| Medium | 4.0–6.9 | Warning under the source baseline. | Build-summary remediation notes. |
| Low | 0.1–3.9 | Non-blocking under the source baseline. | Informational report entry. |

