Submission accepted means **pending**. An incomplete/failed/timed-out assessment blocks progression. Critical/High results remain blocked; no exception or suppression schema was supplied. Formal exception handling needs the actual authorized process, not an invented bypass flag. Store the assessment ID and exact candidate/hash association.

