shasum -a 256 "$MOBILE_DELIVERY_ARTIFACT"
```

`MOBILE_DELIVERY_ARTIFACT` is an example-owned input bound to the approved signed result when required. Also verify package/bundle, version/build, route, source, template, gate associations, and expected signature. Keep bytes stable after hashing; record new hashes after transformation/re-signing.

<MermaidZoom title="Internal distribution: upload is not the completion boundary">

```mermaid
