## 5. Continue later builds without reenrollment

The Build & Release Kit describes a recurring distribution worker monitoring successful builds on the enrolled source branch. It reuses the app and advances eligible candidates using a **durable milestone cursor**.

On restart, associate the checkpoint with the exact candidate/route and reconcile an uncertain in-flight write read-only. Resume only reviewed remaining work; do not reset the cursor, duplicate upload, or replay enrollment. The internal cursor/concurrency/readback implementation still needs its actual contract.

## 6. Report each route independently

| Route | Build | Signing | Destination/user result |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `qa_android` | Actual result. | Actual result. | Exact version/audience evidence. |
| `qa_ios` | Actual result. | Actual result. | Exact version/audience evidence. |
| `uat_android` | Actual result. | Actual result. | Exact version/audience evidence. |
| `uat_ios` | Actual result. | Actual result. | Exact version/audience evidence. |

